  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for reviewing governance structure and organizational assessment, and for wellness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As an African-headquartered research and capacity-strengthening organization, the Partnership for Economic Policy (PEP) works with national research teams throughout the Global South to develop high-quality, locally generated evidence to inform better decisions in policy and practice. This grant will allow PEP to strengthen their organizational structures, capacities, and procedures to support resilient growth and expansion. There is also an allocation in this grant for wellness in furtherance of the organization&#x2019;s charitable purpose.</narrative>
  </description>
